  <author>
    <name>Nate Koenig</name>
  </author>
  <description>Derived copy of https://fuel.gazebosim.org/1.0/OpenRobotics/models/House%201 version 3 (Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal, https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/); original model directory /home/konstantinos/.local/share/aerial-qrl/fuel_cache/fuel.gazebosim.org/openrobotics/models/house%201/3. Defect: House 1 v3 ships only an Ogre1 material script (House_1/Diffuse) and its mesh has no texture reference, so it renders black in Gazebo Sim (A2 pass 1). Change: derived copy: same mesh for visual and collision (absolute file:// path, scale 1.5), material replaced by PBR metal workflow with the original House_1_Diffuse.png albedo and House_1_Normal.png normal maps; metalness 0 and roughness 0.9 are declared engineering values (SDF default 0.5 each); House_1_Spec.png unused; original files untouched.</description>
</model>
